<BaseLayout title="Non-Affiliation Notice" description="WasmStore is an independent and unofficial browser-game directory. Learn how game names, trademarks, community ports, and third-party links are presented." path="/non-affiliation">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">PIXEL ARCADE · INDEPENDENT PROJECT</div><h1>NON-AFFILIATION <span class="gradient-text">NOTICE</span></h1><p>Clear information about the directory's independent status and the ownership of third-party names, games, and creative work.</p></div></section>
  <article class="prose wrap legal-page">
    <p class="legal-kicker">INDEPENDENCE / TRADEMARKS / THIRD-PARTY LINKS</p>
    <h2>1. An independent, unofficial directory</h2><p>WasmStore is an independent website that helps visitors discover browser-playable games, web ports, demos, repositories, and community projects. Unless a specific page expressly states otherwise, WasmStore is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially connected to any game developer, publisher, console manufacturer, platform, studio, or trademark owner referenced on this site.</p>
    <h2>2. Game names and trademarks</h2><p>Names such as game titles, company names, platform names, logos, and related marks belong to their respective owners. These names may appear to identify a game or help visitors find relevant information. Their appearance does not imply that the owner has reviewed, approved, sponsored, or partnered with WasmStore.</p>
    <h2>3. Artwork, characters, music, and other assets</h2><p>Game artwork, screenshots, characters, music, sound effects, source code, and other assets may be protected by copyright, trademark, license terms, or other rights. Rights remain with the relevant owner or licensor. A directory listing does not grant permission to copy, adapt, host, or redistribute those materials.</p>
    <h2>4. Community ports and external projects</h2><p>Some browser-game projects are created or maintained by independent developers and communities. The existence of a link does not mean WasmStore operates that project or has audited its code, files, safety, availability, or licensing. Check the original project page, repository, and license for authoritative information before using or reusing any software or assets.</p>
    <h2>5. External websites and services</h2><p>Links may lead to services outside our control. External websites can change their content, privacy practices, availability, and terms without notice. When you leave WasmStore or load a third-party embed, the destination's policies govern the service it provides.</p>
    <h2>6. No implied endorsement or warranty</h2><p>Listing a game or project is for discovery and identification only. It should not be interpreted as a recommendation, security certification, compatibility guarantee, official distribution channel, or statement that a rights holder has authorized the listing.</p>
    <h2>7. Questions, corrections, and rights concerns</h2><p>If you represent a rights holder and believe a listing is inaccurate or creates confusion, please contact us through the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>. For requests to review a link or listing on intellectual-property grounds, read the <a href="/copyright">Copyright and Takedown Policy</a>.</p>
    <p class="legal-note"><strong>In short:</strong> WasmStore is an independent discovery directory. Third-party names and intellectual property remain with their respective owners, and no affiliation or endorsement should be inferred unless expressly stated.</p>
  </article>
  <style>.legal-page{max-width:900px;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:64px;line-height:1.8}.legal-page .legal-kicker{font:700 11px/1.5 var(--font-pixel);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#6b55d8}.legal-page h2{font-family:var(--font-pixel);font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.4;margin-top:34px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);text-transform:uppercase}.legal-page p,.legal-page li{font-size:16px}.legal-page a{color:#5b43c6;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:3px}.legal-page a:hover{color:#d73569}.legal-note{background:#fff;padding:18px;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink);margin-top:30px}@media(max-width:600px){.legal-page{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.legal-page p,.legal-page li{font-size:15px}.legal-page h2{font-size:17px}}</style>
</BaseLayout>